UXDOS16 V0.1.0
For the Commander X16
>>RUN CMDSHELL.COM
C>LIST HEL        LIST HELLO.TXT
Hello from the SD card.
C>list docs\re            list docs\README.TXT
DOCS holds LONG.TXT, 50 lines of 64 bytes.
C>VER   VER   VERSION
UXDOS16 V0.1.0
C>VER   VER   VERSION       VER
UXDOS16 V0.1.0
C>PRI   PRINT "TAB"
TAB
C>CD DO     CD DOCS\
C>PRINT CURDIR$
C:\DOCS
C>CD \
C>CD DO     CD DOCS\        CD DOS\
C>PRINT CURDIR$
C:\DOS
C>CD \
C>XYZ   XYZ
Bad command or file name
C>PATH$ = "C:\DOS"
